    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just... floating. there's no ground anymore. i look around and nothing feels real or like it belongs to me. it's like i'm just drifting through this life without any anchor, and honestly, the weight of trying to find one is getting so heavy. i just want to stop fighting the current and just let go.",
